cifar10-256.bin, mnist-256-images-idx3-ubyte and mnist-256-labels-idx1-ubyte
are generated, not drawn from CIFAR-10 or MNIST, neither of which states a
licence that permits redistribution. They are 256 records each in the
datasets' file formats: a CIFAR-10 class is a colour and a stripe
direction, an MNIST digit a 5 by 7 bitmap glyph. They carry the
repository's Apache-2.0 license. To regenerate them:

    python3 scripts/gen-dataset-fixtures.py [OUT_DIR]

OUT_DIR defaults to this directory.

The images/ directory is generated by scripts/gen-image-fixtures.py and
carries the repository's Apache-2.0 license. hymenoptera/ and style/
record their sources in their own NOTICE files.
